    "detailed_description": "&quot;Know&quot; is a cute, eerie, and slightly poignant adventure game. Explore and uncover the secrets of this world while avoiding the enigmatic creatures known as &quot;kaibutu.&quot;<br><br><strong><u>Story</u></strong><br>The protagonist awakens in a mysterious world and hears a cryptic voice. &quot;Follow my instructions&quot; - whether to obey or not is up to you. In a peculiar town dominated by terrifying &quot;kaibutu,&quot; can the protagonist unveil the secrets of this world?<br><br><strong><u>Exploration and Action</u></strong><br>You control the player and can explore the eerie world. Search for items, cooperate with friendly &quot;kaibutu,&quot; and progress further. You may encounter hostile &quot;kaibutu&quot; and falling into their clutches results in instant death and a quick restart.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/0509d311fa45628d9f39c037769c2aab.poster.avif?t=1728773788\" width=694 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/0509d311fa45628d9f39c037769c2aab.webm?t=1728773788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/0509d311fa45628d9f39c037769c2aab.mp4?t=1728773788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Choices</u></strong><br>In crucial situations, the &quot;mysterious voice&quot; issues commands. Your chosen decisions will impact the story's outcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/ba91be51dc1185f8ab132fee455927ea.poster.avif?t=1728773788\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/ba91be51dc1185f8ab132fee455927ea.webm?t=1728773788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651980/extras/ba91be51dc1185f8ab132fee455927ea.mp4?t=1728773788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
